R has a lot of good tools for file manipulation.  You could try something like this

ff <- list.files( 'Volumes/Aves/DATA', recursive = TRUE, full = TRUE, pattern = 'txt') # list all txt files in drive
ff.subset <- grep('dataIWant', ff, value = TRUE) # find only files with 'dataIWant' in path name
file.copy( ff.subset, file.path( my_local_dir, basename(ff) ) # copy all files to local

